  "scarcity_note": "REDGE_REAUDIT_SCARCITY_A1 PASS (19 traits 90+, 1 at 95+: Garrett FMV 96 LEAGUE_DEFINING; no 97+; overall 90+: Garrett 95, Parsons 91). Narrative text grep-verified before the stage ran.",
